{
  "about": "Golden riichi scoring cases. Expected values come from the published sources below or from applying their written rules by hand, never from running this engine. Defaults: round East, seat South, ron, no kiriage, kuitan on. Winner's seat wind decides dealer. Honors are written as characters because this engine's 5z is 中, not Tenhou's 白.",
  "sources": {
    "EMA25": "EMA Riichi Rulebook 2025 v1.1, https://mahjong.dk/hubfs/Mahjong%20documents/Riichi/Riichi_Rulebook_2025_v1.1.pdf. §3.4.4 counters, §4.1.1 minipoints, §4.1.2 limits, §4.2 yaku, §4.3 examples (tile pictures are not in the PDF text, so tiles in ex* cases are constructed to match the written yaku, han and points), p.43 scoring tables",
    "WRC22": "WRC Rules 2022 v1.1, https://static1.squarespace.com/static/634a7884c297a25f06589b79/t/636136c78306ca6579c03fd0/1667315409318/WRC_Rules_2022_20220708_site.pdf. §2 abstract, §11.2 calculation, yaku list",
    "MJLIB": "MahjongRepository/mahjong, tests/hand_calculating/tests_yaku_calculation.py and tests_fu_calculation.py, https://github.com/MahjongRepository/mahjong. Named test gave tiles, han and/or fu; winds are adapted where noted so the pair stays valueless",
    "HAND": "Worked by hand from the EMA25 §4.1.1 fu table and §4.2 yaku rules",
    "TRAINER": "https://riichi-score-trainer.pages.dev/points, non-kiriage values for 4 han 30 fu and 3 han 60 fu (JPML and Mahjong Soul)"
  },
